{
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "# 🚀 AnyINB — The Ultimate Universal Notebook\n\nWelcome to your universal interactive notebook! \n\n## 🌟 New Features Showcase\n- **Persistent Sessions**: Variables defined in one Python/Node/Bash cell carry over to the next!\n- **Data Visualization**: Click the 📊 **Chart** button on any table output to render an interactive Bar Chart.\n- **Data Exporting**: Instantly export query results to CSV or JSON with one click.\n- **.env Variables**: Create a `.env` file in your workspace, and use `{{VAR_NAME}}` in HTTP/WebSocket/GraphQL queries.\n- **Docker Execution**: Turn on `anyinb.useDocker` in VS Code settings to run code securely inside containers.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "## 🐍 Python Persistent REPL\nVariables now persist across cell executions!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "print(\"Initializing variables...\")\nmy_name = \"AnyINB Explorer\"\ncounter = 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "counter += 1\nprint(f\"Hello {my_name}! Counter is now {counter}\")"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 📊 Data Visualization & Exporting\nRun the SQL below (needs connection), then click **Chart**, **CSV**, or **JSON** in the output header!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "sqlite",
      "value": "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sales (month VARCHAR(20), revenue INT);\nINSERT INTO sales VALUES ('Jan', 500), ('Feb', 800), ('Mar', 1200);\nSELECT * FROM sales;"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 🌐 GraphQL API Examples\nChange the cell language to `graphql`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "graphql",
      "value": "POST https://countries.trevorblades.com/\n\nquery {\n  countries(filter: {continent: {eq: \"EU\"}}) {\n    name\n    code\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 🔌 WebSockets Example\nChange the cell language to `websocket`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "websocket",
      "value": "ws://echo.websocket.events\n\nHello from AnyINB!"
    }
  ]
}
